        "first transition state",
        "cationic intermediate",
        "second transition state",
        "products"
      ],
      "default": "reactants",
      "teaches": "Electrophilic aromatic bromination is a two-step process: a slow, high-barrier attack on the electrophile gives a carbocation intermediate, which then loses H+ over a much smaller second barrier."
    },
